1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,474
Bugungi videoda nima haqida?

2
00:00:03,475 --> 00:00:10,000
Bu N4 grammatikasining umumiy mazmuni.

3
00:00:10,008 --> 00:00:11,508
Sahna 1: Suhbat / Yaponcha intervyu suhbati

4
00:00:11,508 --> 00:00:14,248
Kechirasiz, kirib ketyapman.

5
00:00:14,271 --> 00:00:17,104
Tanishganimdan xursandman.

6
00:00:17,127 --> 00:00:19,361
Tanishganimdan xursandman.

7
00:00:19,384 --> 00:00:22,453
Iltimos, oʻtiring.

8
00:00:22,476 --> 00:00:24,469
Ha.

9
00:00:24,492 --> 00:00:27,200
Rahmat.

10
00:00:27,224 --> 00:00:30,924
Bu yarim stavka uchun intervyu, shundaymi?

11
00:00:30,947 --> 00:00:34,290
Ismingiz nima?

12
00:00:34,314 --> 00:00:37,014
Yamada.

13
00:00:37,037 --> 00:00:39,903
Iltimos, marhamat.

14
00:00:39,926 --> 00:00:43,760
Yamada-san, siz talabamisiz?

15
00:00:43,783 --> 00:00:46,049
Ha.

16
00:00:46,072 --> 00:00:49,455
Universitetning ikkinchi kursman.

17
00:00:49,478 --> 00:00:51,978
Shundaymi.

18
00:00:52,001 --> 00:00:55,944
Yapon tilini oʻrganish qanday?

19
00:00:55,967 --> 00:01:01,515
Kanjilar qiyin, lekin suhbat qilish qiziqarli.

20
00:01:01,539 --> 00:01:04,689
Ajoyib!

21
00:01:04,713 --> 00:01:09,547
Yamada-san, qanday ishlarni bajara olasiz?

22
00:01:09,570 --> 00:01:13,203
Men ovqat pishirishni bilaman.

23
00:01:13,226 --> 00:01:16,403
Mijozlarga xizmat koʻrsatishni ham bilaman.

24
00:01:16,426 --> 00:01:19,406
Ovqat pishirishni bilasizmi?!

25
00:01:19,430 --> 00:01:23,100
Qanday taomlar pishira olasiz?

26
00:01:23,123 --> 00:01:27,304
Kare va gamburger kabi taomlarni pishira olaman.

27
00:01:27,328 --> 00:01:29,697
Yaxshi ekan!

28
00:01:29,720 --> 00:01:35,057
Bu doʻkon hafta oxirlarida juda band boʻladi.

29
00:01:35,080 --> 00:01:39,435
Shanba va yakshanba kunlari ham ishlashingiz mumkinmi?

30
00:01:39,458 --> 00:01:43,159
Shanba kuni ishlay olaman.

31
00:01:43,183 --> 00:01:47,299
Yakshanba kuni biroz qiyin.

32
00:01:47,323 --> 00:01:49,489
Nima uchun?

33
00:01:49,512 --> 00:01:54,271
Yakshanba kunlari universitetda darslarim bor.

34
00:01:54,294 --> 00:01:56,794
Shundaymi.

35
00:01:56,817 --> 00:02:00,563
Faqat shanba kunlari ham yaxshi.

36
00:02:00,587 --> 00:02:02,853
Rahmat.

37
00:02:02,876 --> 00:02:10,352
Yamada-san, siz ochiqkoʻngil va yapon tilini yaxshi bilasiz, juda yaxshi!

38
00:02:10,376 --> 00:02:13,143
Rostdanmi?

39
00:02:13,166 --> 00:02:15,722
Xursand boʻldim.

40
00:02:15,745 --> 00:02:20,245
Iltimos, bizning doʻkonda ishlang.

41
00:02:20,268 --> 00:02:22,336
Ha.

42
00:02:22,359 --> 00:02:26,026
Harakat qilaman.

43
00:02:26,049 --> 00:02:31,207
Doʻkon bekatga yaqin, juda qulay.

44
00:02:31,230 --> 00:02:33,064
Ha.

45
00:02:33,087 --> 00:02:35,767
Bilaman.

46
00:02:35,790 --> 00:02:39,660
Forma ertaga beriladi.

47
00:02:39,683 --> 00:02:42,117
Tushunarli.

48
00:02:42,140 --> 00:02:46,276
Ertaga soat nechada kelishingiz mumkin?

49
00:02:46,299 --> 00:02:49,399
Soat uchda kelolaman.

50
00:02:49,422 --> 00:02:52,800
Unda, kutamiz.

51
00:02:52,824 --> 00:02:54,758
Ha.

52
00:02:54,781 --> 00:02:57,881
Iltimos, marhamat.

53
00:03:05,241 --> 00:03:06,741
Sahna 2: Kiyim tanlash va kiyib koʻrish

54
00:03:06,741 --> 00:03:11,607
Kechirasiz, biroz qarab turishim mumkinmi?

55
00:03:11,630 --> 00:03:14,863
Ha, xush kelibsiz.

56
00:03:14,886 --> 00:03:17,834
Iltimos, qarang.

57
00:03:17,858 --> 00:03:23,091
Bu sviter juda issiqdek koʻrinadi.

58
00:03:23,114 --> 00:03:28,951
Ha, bu qish mavsumi uchun yangi sviter.

59
00:03:28,975 --> 00:03:32,309
Ranglari ham juda chiroyli, shunday emasmi?

60
00:03:32,332 --> 00:03:36,965
Ha, juda mashhur.

61
00:03:36,988 --> 00:03:40,688
Buni kiyib koʻrsam boʻladimi?

62
00:03:40,711 --> 00:03:43,744
Albatta.

63
00:03:43,767 --> 00:03:46,700
Koʻzgu u yerda.

64
00:03:46,723 --> 00:03:49,062
Rahmat.

65
00:03:49,086 --> 00:03:51,962
Qanday, yaxshimi?

66
00:03:51,985 --> 00:03:54,656
Menga tushadimi?

67
00:03:54,679 --> 00:03:59,346
Ha, juda yaxshi tushgan.

68
00:03:59,369 --> 00:04:03,469
Biroz katta koʻrinadi.

69
00:04:03,492 --> 00:04:06,128
Shundaymi.

70
00:04:06,151 --> 00:04:10,784
Kichikroq oʻlchami ham bor.

71
00:04:10,807 --> 00:04:15,241
Unda kichik oʻlchamini kiyib koʻraman.

72
00:04:15,264 --> 00:04:18,437
Iltimos, biroz kutib turing.

73
00:04:18,460 --> 00:04:21,206
Kutib turdingiz.

74
00:04:21,230 --> 00:04:23,930
Bu yerda.

75
00:04:23,953 --> 00:04:26,323
Rahmat.

76
00:04:26,346 --> 00:04:30,500
A, bu aynan mos keladi.

77
00:04:30,524 --> 00:04:33,862
Juda iliq koʻrinadi.

78
00:04:33,885 --> 00:04:40,159
Ha, yengil va juda qulay.

79
00:04:40,183 --> 00:04:43,533
Boshqa ranglarini ham koʻrasizmi?

80
00:04:43,556 --> 00:04:47,232
Boshqa qanday ranglari bor?

81
00:04:47,255 --> 00:04:50,769
Qizil va koʻk ranglari bor.

82
00:04:50,793 --> 00:04:54,426
Koʻk sviter ham yaxshi koʻrinadi.

83
00:04:54,449 --> 00:04:58,920
Ha, koʻk rang ham mashhur.

84
00:04:58,944 --> 00:05:02,922
Hmm, qaysi birini tanlashda qiynalyapman.

85
00:05:02,945 --> 00:05:06,245
Qaysi biri yaxshiroq boʻlardi?

86
00:05:06,268 --> 00:05:10,735
Sizda oq rangli kiyimlar koʻpmi?

87
00:05:10,758 --> 00:05:15,424
Ha, oq rangli kiyimlarni koʻp kiyaman.

88
00:05:15,447 --> 00:05:21,481
Unda koʻk sviter sizga koʻproq mos keladi deb oʻylayman.

89
00:05:21,504 --> 00:05:23,453
Ha, shunday.

90
00:05:23,477 --> 00:05:27,818
Unda koʻk sviterini sotib olaman.

91
00:05:27,841 --> 00:05:30,010
Rahmat.

92
00:05:30,034 --> 00:05:32,967
Kassaga oʻtib keting.

93
00:05:32,990 --> 00:05:34,490
3-SAHNA: Tugʻilgan kun sovgʻasi maslahati

94
00:05:34,490 --> 00:05:39,557
Yaqin orada Suzuki saning tugʻilgan kuni, shunday emasmi?

95
00:05:39,580 --> 00:05:42,365
Ha, shunday.

96
00:05:42,388 --> 00:05:46,066
Kelgusi juma kunida.

97
00:05:46,090 --> 00:05:50,190
Unga biror sovgʻa beramizmi?

98
00:05:50,213 --> 00:05:52,747
Yaxshi ekan!

99
00:05:52,770 --> 00:05:56,203
Nima bersak boʻlardi?

100
00:05:56,226 --> 00:06:00,659
Suzuki san nimani xohlardi?

101
00:06:00,682 --> 00:06:04,827
Hmm, aniq bilmayman.

102
00:06:04,851 --> 00:06:09,485
Oʻtgan yili tugʻilgan kunida nima berdingiz?

103
00:06:09,508 --> 00:06:13,608
Oʻtgan yili men kitob bergan edim.

104
00:06:13,630 --> 00:06:17,184
Men esa shirinlik bergan edim.

105
00:06:17,208 --> 00:06:23,647
Bu yil ikki boʻlib birga biror narsa sotib olamizmi?

106
00:06:23,670 --> 00:06:28,104
Suzuki san kofeni yaxshi koʻradi, shunday emasmi?

107
00:06:28,127 --> 00:06:32,478
Ha, har kuni koʻp ichadi.

108
00:06:32,501 --> 00:06:37,034
Unda kofe finjoni qanday?

109
00:06:37,057 --> 00:06:39,625
Yaxshi ekan!

110
00:06:39,649 --> 00:06:43,558
Kofe donalarini ham birga bersak boʻladi.

111
00:06:43,581 --> 00:06:46,820
Albatta xursand boʻladi deb oʻylayman.

112
00:06:46,843 --> 00:06:49,910
Qayerdan sotib olamiz?

113
00:06:49,933 --> 00:06:54,599
Bekat oldida yangi doʻkon ochilgan.

114
00:06:54,622 --> 00:06:58,756
Unda ertaga u yerga borib koʻramiz.

115
00:06:58,779 --> 00:07:04,316
Aytgancha, Suzuki san qizil rangni yaxshi koʻradi, shunday emasmi?

116
00:07:04,339 --> 00:07:08,972
Ha, qizil mashinam bor-ku.

117
00:07:08,995 --> 00:07:13,303
Shunda, qizil kosani qidiramiz.

118
00:07:13,326 --> 00:07:15,364
Yaxshi ekan!

119
00:07:15,388 --> 00:07:21,888
A, men kelgusi hafta Suzuki senga pirog ham pishirib beraman.

120
00:07:21,911 --> 00:07:25,177
Bu juda zo'r ekan-ku!

121
00:07:25,200 --> 00:07:28,267
Men ham yeymoqchiman.

122
00:07:28,290 --> 00:07:33,190
Shunda, sizning tug'ilgan kuningizga ham pishirib beraman.

123
00:07:33,213 --> 00:07:35,756
Rostdanmi?

124
00:07:35,780 --> 00:07:38,685
Kutib qolaman.

125
00:07:38,708 --> 00:07:44,375
Suzuki saning tug'ilgan kunini hamma bilan birga nishonlaymiz.

126
00:07:44,398 --> 00:07:49,264
Ha, men restoranni oldindan band qilib qo'yaman.

127
00:07:49,287 --> 00:07:52,042
Iltimos, marhamat.

128
00:07:52,066 --> 00:07:56,299
Albatta, juda qiziqarli kecha bo'ladi.

129
00:07:56,322 --> 00:07:57,822
4-Sahna: Sayohat rejalari: Dengizmi yoki issiq buloqmi? / Sayohatni rejalashtirish: Dengiz yoki issiq buloq?

130
00:07:57,822 --> 00:08:03,155
Kelgusi dam olish kunlarida hammamiz birga sayohatga chiqsak-chi?

131
00:08:03,178 --> 00:08:06,153
Yaxshi ekan!

132
00:08:06,177 --> 00:08:09,128
Qayerga boramiz?

133
00:08:09,152 --> 00:08:13,652
Men dengizga borishni xohlayman.

134
00:08:13,675 --> 00:08:16,309
Dengizmi?

135
00:08:16,332 --> 00:08:21,637
Lekin, dam olish kunlarida yomg'ir yog'ishi mumkin-ku.

136
00:08:21,660 --> 00:08:23,693
Ha?

137
00:08:23,716 --> 00:08:26,216
Rostdanmi?

138
00:08:26,239 --> 00:08:30,575
Ha. Ob-havo ma'lumotida aytishgan edi.

139
00:08:30,599 --> 00:08:34,106
Bu juda afsus.

140
00:08:34,130 --> 00:08:39,630
Yomg'ir yog'ishi mumkin bo'lgani uchun, issiq buloqlarga borsak-chi?

141
00:08:39,653 --> 00:08:44,847
Issiq buloqmi? Yaxshi fikr ekan.

142
00:08:44,870 --> 00:08:49,581
Issiq buloq bo'lsa, yomg'ir yog'sa ham kirishimiz mumkin.

143
00:08:49,605 --> 00:08:53,723
Qaysi issiq buloq yaxshi bo'ladi?

144
00:08:53,746 --> 00:08:56,459
Hakonega borsak-chi?

145
00:08:56,482 --> 00:08:59,516
Tokiodan yaqin.

146
00:08:59,539 --> 00:09:02,873
Hakone yaxshi ekan.

147
00:09:02,896 --> 00:09:06,597
Mazali taomlar ham yeymoqchiman.

148
00:09:06,621 --> 00:09:10,888
Shunda, mehmonxonani band qilsakmi?

149
00:09:10,911 --> 00:09:13,623
Ha, iltimos.

150
00:09:13,646 --> 00:09:16,951
Qanday mehmonxona yaxshi bo'ladi?

151
00:09:16,975 --> 00:09:21,054
Ochiq osmon ostidagi hammomli mehmonxona yaxshi bo'lardi.

152
00:09:21,077 --> 00:09:25,510
Tushunarli. Qidirib ko'raman.

153
00:09:25,533 --> 00:09:28,900
A, mashinada boramizmi?

154
00:09:28,924 --> 00:09:31,624
Poyezdda boramizmi?

155
00:09:31,647 --> 00:09:35,083
Poyezdda borsak-chi?

156
00:09:35,106 --> 00:09:37,840
Nima uchun?

157
00:09:37,863 --> 00:09:42,696
Dam olish kunlarida yo'l tirband bo'lishi mumkin.

158
00:09:42,719 --> 00:09:47,905
Tushunarli. Poyezd bo'lsa, vaqt ma'lum bo'ladi.

159
00:09:47,929 --> 00:09:52,595
Ha. Bekatda bentolarni sotib olib yeymiz.

160
00:09:52,618 --> 00:09:55,561
Bu juda qiziqarli ko'rinadi.

161
00:09:55,585 --> 00:09:59,343
Yana kimlarni taklif qilamiz?

162
00:09:59,367 --> 00:10:03,201
Tanaka sanini ham taklif qilsak-chi?

163
00:10:03,224 --> 00:10:06,357
Yaxshi ekan!

164
00:10:06,380 --> 00:10:09,480
Ertaga so'rab ko'raman.

165
00:10:09,503 --> 00:10:12,736
Shunda, iltimos qilaman.

166
00:10:12,759 --> 00:10:16,693
Ha. Keyinroq aloqaga chiqaman.

167
00:10:16,717 --> 00:10:18,217
5-Sahna: Barbekyu tayyorlash / Barbekyu uchun tayyorgarlik

168
00:10:18,217 --> 00:10:22,883
Kelgusi haftadagi barbekyu juda qiziqarli bo'ladi-ku.

169
00:10:22,906 --> 00:10:27,940
Ha. Ko'p ovqat yeymoqchiman.

170
00:10:27,963 --> 00:10:31,429
Tayyorgarlikni qanday qilamiz?

171
00:10:31,452 --> 00:10:35,961
Men go'shtni sotib olaman.

172
00:10:35,984 --> 00:10:38,418
Rahmat.

173
00:10:38,441 --> 00:10:44,022
Mol go'shti va cho'chqa go'shtidan ko'p sotib olmoqchiman.

174
00:10:44,046 --> 00:10:47,781
Tovuq go'shtini ham sotib qo'ying.

175
00:10:47,804 --> 00:10:50,540
Ma'lum.

176
00:10:50,564 --> 00:10:53,698
Sabzavotlar haqida nima qilamiz?

177
00:10:53,721 --> 00:10:58,072
Sabzavotlarni men to'g'rayman.

178
00:10:58,095 --> 00:11:00,664
Katta yordam bo'ldi.

179
00:11:00,687 --> 00:11:03,759
Ichimliklar ham kerak bo'ladi-ku.

180
00:11:03,783 --> 00:11:09,254
Ertaga bozorga xarid qilishga boraman deb o'ylayman.

181
00:11:09,278 --> 00:11:14,178
Og'ir bo'ladi, men ham yordamga boraman.

182
00:11:14,201 --> 00:11:16,377
Rahmat.

183
00:11:16,401 --> 00:11:20,467
Pivo va choy sotib olamiz.

184
00:11:20,490 --> 00:11:22,791
Ha, shunday.

185
00:11:22,814 --> 00:11:26,548
Idish-tovoqlar bormi?

186
00:11:26,570 --> 00:11:32,079
Uyda bor, men olib boraman deb o'ylayman.

187
00:11:32,103 --> 00:11:35,814
Chiqindilar paketini ham sotib olamiz.

188
00:11:35,837 --> 00:11:39,371
Ha, eslab qolaman.

189
00:11:39,394 --> 00:11:43,227
Ob-havo qanday bo'ladi?

190
00:11:43,250 --> 00:11:46,366
Oqshomda havo ochiq bo'ladi deb o'ylayman.

191
00:11:46,390 --> 00:11:50,057
Agar yomg'ir yog'sa, nima qilamiz?

192
00:11:50,080 --> 00:11:55,613
Yomg'ir yog'sa, uyimizda ziyofat qilamiz.

193
00:11:55,636 --> 00:11:58,628
Bu ham yaxshi fikr.

194
00:11:58,651 --> 00:12:02,584
Do'stimiz Sato ham keladi.

195
00:12:02,607 --> 00:12:07,480
Sato gitara chalishni rejalashtirayapti.

196
00:12:07,504 --> 00:12:10,804
Bu juda qiziqarli bo'ladi.

197
00:12:10,827 --> 00:12:14,728
Men kamera tayyorlab qo'yaman.

198
00:12:14,752 --> 00:12:18,542
Ko'p suratga tushamiz.

199
00:12:18,565 --> 00:12:23,338
Ha. Tez orada hafta boshlanmasinmi?

200
00:12:23,362 --> 00:12:25,995
Rostdan ham.

201
00:12:26,018 --> 00:12:29,122
Tayyorgarlikni yaxshi qilaylik.

202
00:12:29,145 --> 00:12:32,845
Ha, iltimos.

203
00:12:32,868 --> 00:12:34,368
6-SAHNA: Ijara xonani izlash shartlari

204
00:12:34,368 --> 00:12:39,606
Uzr, men xona izlayapman.

205
00:12:39,629 --> 00:12:42,129
Xush kelibsiz!

206
00:12:42,152 --> 00:12:46,023
Qanday xonani izlayapsiz?

207
00:12:46,047 --> 00:12:51,880
Vokzaldan yaqin va tinch joydagi xona yaxshi bo'lardi.

208
00:12:51,903 --> 00:12:56,536
Vokzaldan piyoda necha daqiqa masofada bo'lishi kerak?

209
00:12:56,559 --> 00:13:03,026
Vokzaldan piyoda o'n daqiqadan kam masofadagi xonani izlayapman.

210
00:13:03,049 --> 00:13:05,919
Tushunarli.

211
00:13:05,942 --> 00:13:10,076
Ijara narxi qancha bo'lishi kerak?

212
00:13:10,099 --> 00:13:14,289
Sakkiz ming yen atrofidagi xona yaxshi bo'lardi.

213
00:13:14,312 --> 00:13:18,627
Bu xona qanday?

214
00:13:18,651 --> 00:13:23,584
Bu kecha internetda ko'rgan e'lon edi.

215
00:13:23,607 --> 00:13:26,041
Shundaymi.

216
00:13:26,064 --> 00:13:30,964
Vokzaldan besh daqiqa masofada, juda qulay joyda.

217
00:13:30,987 --> 00:13:34,087
Xona kengmi?

218
00:13:34,110 --> 00:13:36,508
Ha.

219
00:13:36,531 --> 00:13:41,065
Janub tomonda derazasi bor, yorug' xona.

220
00:13:41,088 --> 00:13:43,754
Yaxshi ekan!

221
00:13:43,777 --> 00:13:47,244
Uy hayvonlarini boqishga ruxsat bormi?

222
00:13:47,267 --> 00:13:50,059
Kechirasiz.

223
00:13:50,083 --> 00:13:53,917
Uy hayvonlari boqadigan kishilar yashay olmaydi.

224
00:13:53,940 --> 00:13:56,895
Shundaymi.

225
00:13:56,918 --> 00:14:00,700
Menda mushuk bor.

226
00:14:00,724 --> 00:14:05,159
Mushuk boqadigan kishilar yashay oladigan xonani izlayapman.

227
00:14:05,182 --> 00:14:08,249
Iltimos, biroz kutib turing.

228
00:14:08,272 --> 00:14:10,544
Iltimos.

229
00:14:10,567 --> 00:14:13,901
Ushbu xona qanday?

230
00:14:13,924 --> 00:14:17,690
Xona bir oz eskiroq koʻrinadi.

231
00:14:17,713 --> 00:14:19,947
Ha.

232
00:14:19,970 --> 00:14:24,603
Ammo, xonani yangidan taʼmirladik-ku!

233
00:14:24,626 --> 00:14:28,693
Yaqin atrofda supermarket bormi?

234
00:14:28,716 --> 00:14:30,982
Ha.

235
00:14:31,005 --> 00:14:34,981
Piyoda uch daqiqada boradigan supermarket bor.

236
00:14:35,005 --> 00:14:38,838
Bu juda qulay ekan.

237
00:14:38,861 --> 00:14:44,128
Bu shahar tinch va xavfsiz, shuning uchun tavsiya qilaman.

238
00:14:44,151 --> 00:14:48,895
Bu xonani bir marta koʻrishni istardim.

239
00:14:48,918 --> 00:14:51,357
Tushunarli.

240
00:14:51,381 --> 00:14:54,557
Hozir koʻrishga boramizmi?

241
00:14:54,581 --> 00:14:57,814
Ha, iltimos.

242
00:14:57,837 --> 00:15:01,670
Xoʻsh, mashinada sizni olib boraman.

243
00:15:01,693 --> 00:15:04,393
Bu tomonga iltimos.

244
00:15:04,416 --> 00:15:06,398
Ha.

245
00:15:06,422 --> 00:15:09,055
Iltimos, marhamat.

246
00:15:09,078 --> 00:15:12,664
Yuklaringizni men koʻtarib beraman.

247
00:15:12,687 --> 00:15:16,060
Rahmat.

248
00:15:16,084 --> 00:15:17,584
7-Sahna: Koʻchish va karey tayyorlash

249
00:15:17,584 --> 00:15:23,936
Bugun koʻchishda yordam berganingiz uchun rahmat.

250
00:15:23,960 --> 00:15:28,226
Yoʻq, arzimaydi.

251
00:15:28,249 --> 00:15:34,431
Ogʻir yuklarni koʻtarib berganingizdan juda minnatdorman.

252
00:15:34,455 --> 00:15:37,824
Gʻamxoʻrlik qilmang.

253
00:15:37,847 --> 00:15:41,354
Qorni ochib qoldi, shunday emasmi?

254
00:15:41,378 --> 00:15:43,757
Ha, shunday.

255
00:15:43,780 --> 00:15:47,325
Nima yeyishimiz mumkin?

256
00:15:47,349 --> 00:15:52,782
Men tushlikni tayyorlab beraman.

257
00:15:52,805 --> 00:15:55,342
Rostdanmi?

258
00:15:55,365 --> 00:15:58,199
Xursand boʻldim.

259
00:15:58,222 --> 00:16:01,055
Karey bo‘ladi-mi?

260
00:16:01,078 --> 00:16:05,815
Ha, kareyni juda yaxshi koʻraman.

261
00:16:05,839 --> 00:16:10,379
Unda, biroz kutib turing.

262
00:16:10,402 --> 00:16:12,318
E?

263
00:16:12,342 --> 00:16:15,212
Nima boʻldi?

264
00:16:15,236 --> 00:16:19,988
A, likopchani tushirib yubordim.

265
00:16:20,011 --> 00:16:22,920
Yaxshimisiz?

266
00:16:22,944 --> 00:16:25,977
Jarohat olmadingizmi?

267
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:29,633
Ha, yaxshi.

268
00:16:29,656 --> 00:16:34,690
Likopchani sindirib qoʻyganim uchun uzr.

269
00:16:34,713 --> 00:16:37,813
Gʻamxoʻrlik qilmang.

270
00:16:37,836 --> 00:16:41,408
Men tozalab beraman.

271
00:16:41,431 --> 00:16:45,982
Uzur, rahmat.

272
00:16:46,006 --> 00:16:50,872
Barmogʻingizni kesib olmang.

273
00:16:50,895 --> 00:16:54,162
Ha, ehtiyot boʻlaman.

274
00:16:54,185 --> 00:16:57,318
Axlat qutisi qayerda?

275
00:16:57,341 --> 00:17:01,241
U yerda turgan qutiga tashlang.

276
00:17:01,264 --> 00:17:03,964
Tushunarli.

277
00:17:03,987 --> 00:17:07,157
Rostdan uzr.

278
00:17:07,180 --> 00:17:11,247
Hech kim jarohat olmaganligiga shukur.

279
00:17:11,271 --> 00:17:16,038
Siz juda mehribon ekansiz, rahmat.

280
00:17:16,061 --> 00:17:19,370
Koʻchish qiyin ish ekan-ku.

281
00:17:19,393 --> 00:17:26,583
Ha. Ammo siz yordam berganingiz uchun yaxshi boʻldi.

282
00:17:26,607 --> 00:17:30,707
Yana biror narsa boʻlsa, chaqiring.

283
00:17:30,730 --> 00:17:33,040
Rahmat.

284
00:17:33,063 --> 00:17:36,203
Karey tayyor boʻldi!

285
00:17:36,227 --> 00:17:40,160
Vaa, juda mazali koʻrinadi.

286
00:17:40,183 --> 00:17:43,283
Yeyishni boshlaymiz.

287
00:17:43,306 --> 00:17:44,806
8-Sahna: Guvohnoma chiqarish tartibi

288
00:17:44,806 --> 00:17:47,309
Kechirasiz.

289
00:17:47,333 --> 00:17:50,599
Bir oz vaqt berasizmi?

290
00:17:50,622 --> 00:17:54,656
Ha, nima uchun?

291
00:17:54,679 --> 00:17:59,512
Baholar toʻgʻrisidagi guvohnomani chiqarib berishingiz mumkinmi?

292
00:17:59,535 --> 00:18:02,168
Ma'lum.

293
00:18:02,191 --> 00:18:05,870
Talabalik guvohnomani koʻrsatib qoʻying.

294
00:18:05,894 --> 00:18:09,164
Ha, shu

295
00:18:09,187 --> 00:18:11,520
Rahmat.

296
00:18:11,543 --> 00:18:14,453
Necha dona kerak?

297
00:18:14,477 --> 00:18:17,711
Ikki dona bering, iltimos.

298
00:18:17,734 --> 00:18:20,167
Ma'lum.

299
00:18:20,190 --> 00:18:25,029
Bu qogʻozga ismingizni yozib qoʻyishingiz mumkinmi?

300
00:18:25,052 --> 00:18:29,008
Ha, shu yerga yozaman.

301
00:18:29,032 --> 00:18:32,544
Bunday bo‘ladimi?

302
00:18:32,568 --> 00:18:35,526
Ha, yaxshi.

303
00:18:35,550 --> 00:18:40,668
Afsuski, guvohnoma qachon olsam bo‘ladi?

304
00:18:40,691 --> 00:18:43,885
Ertangi tushdan keyin bo‘ladi.

305
00:18:43,909 --> 00:18:46,542
Ertaga?

306
00:18:46,565 --> 00:18:51,913
Ha, bugun mashina buzulgani uchun.

307
00:18:51,937 --> 00:18:56,709
Ertangi ertalabgacha tayyor bo‘lsa yaxshi bo‘lardi.

308
00:18:56,732 --> 00:18:59,365
Shoshilyapsizmi?

309
00:18:59,388 --> 00:19:05,055
Ha. Ertaga ish intervyusi bor.

310
00:19:05,078 --> 00:19:07,745
Shundaymi.

311
00:19:07,768 --> 00:19:12,203
Unda, bugun kechqurun chiqarib beramiz.

312
00:19:12,227 --> 00:19:14,893
Rostdanmi?

313
00:19:14,916 --> 00:19:17,183
Rahmat.

314
00:19:17,206 --> 00:19:20,673
To‘rt soat atrofida yana keling.

315
00:19:20,696 --> 00:19:24,131
Ha, albatta kelaman.

316
00:19:24,154 --> 00:19:27,987
Intervyuga omad tilayman!

317
00:19:28,010 --> 00:19:32,277
Ha. Intervyuda muvaffaqiyat qozonsam yaxshi bo‘lardi.

318
00:19:32,300 --> 00:19:35,408
Albatta, muvaffaqiyatli bo‘lasiz.

319
00:19:35,431 --> 00:19:39,864
Mehribonligingiz uchun rahmat.

320
00:19:39,887 --> 00:19:44,398
Arzimaydi. Yana savolingiz bormi?

321
00:19:44,422 --> 00:19:47,727
Ha, yaxshi.

322
00:19:47,751 --> 00:19:51,584
Unda, soat to‘rtda kutib qolamiz.

323
00:19:51,607 --> 00:19:54,240
Kechirasiz, kirib ketyapman.

324
00:19:54,263 --> 00:19:55,763
9-sahna: Bekat oldidagi non do‘koni yopilishi va yangi bino

325
00:19:55,763 --> 00:20:02,030
Bekat oldidagi non do‘koni keyingi oy yopilarmish.

326
00:20:02,053 --> 00:20:05,953
E, rostmi?

327
00:20:05,976 --> 00:20:10,885
Ha. Tanakasan shunday degan edi.

328
00:20:10,908 --> 00:20:14,411
Bu juda afsus.

329
00:20:14,435 --> 00:20:19,004
U nonlar juda mazali edi-ku.

330
00:20:19,028 --> 00:20:23,340
Do‘kon egasi kasal bo‘lgan ekan.

331
00:20:23,363 --> 00:20:26,297
Shundaymi?

332
00:20:26,320 --> 00:20:29,455
Xavotirda ekanman.

333
00:20:29,478 --> 00:20:35,411
Non do‘koni yoniga yangi bino qurilarmish.

334
00:20:35,434 --> 00:20:39,970
Vay. Qanday bino?

335
00:20:39,994 --> 00:20:44,461
Katta savdo markazi bo‘lsa kerak.

336
00:20:44,484 --> 00:20:48,117
Bu juda qulay bo‘ladi-ku.

337
00:20:48,140 --> 00:20:53,174
Ha. Kinoteatr ham ochilishi mumkinligini eshitdim.

338
00:20:53,197 --> 00:20:56,230
Kinoteatrmi?

339
00:20:56,253 --> 00:20:58,886
Yaxshi ekan!

340
00:20:58,909 --> 00:21:03,776
Yangi kiyim do‘konlari ham ko‘p ochilarmish.

341
00:21:03,799 --> 00:21:07,510
Xarid qilish qulay bo‘ladi-ku.

342
00:21:07,534 --> 00:21:10,605
Qachon tayyor bo‘ladi?

343
00:21:10,628 --> 00:21:14,544
Keyingi yil bahorda tayyor bo‘lar ekan.

344
00:21:14,568 --> 00:21:17,936
Tezroq bo‘lsa yaxshi bo‘lardi.

345
00:21:17,959 --> 00:21:24,352
Aytgancha, Suzuki-san turmush qurarmish-ku.

346
00:21:24,376 --> 00:21:28,109
E, kim bilan?

347
00:21:28,132 --> 00:21:32,965
Kompaniyadagi odam bilan turmush qurishini aytgan edi.

348
00:21:32,988 --> 00:21:36,266
Bu juda ajablantirdi.

349
00:21:36,290 --> 00:21:41,057
Keyingi oy to‘y qilarmish.

350
00:21:41,080 --> 00:21:44,913
Bizlar ham taklif qilinamizmi?

351
00:21:44,936 --> 00:21:49,169
Hm, bilmayman.

352
00:21:49,192 --> 00:21:54,059
To‘y Gavayida bo‘lar ekan.

353
00:21:54,082 --> 00:21:56,949
 Gavayimi?

354
00:21:56,972 --> 00:21:59,672
Yaxshi ekan!

355
00:21:59,695 --> 00:22:04,395
Men ham Gavayiga borishni xohlardim.

356
00:22:04,418 --> 00:22:07,384
Pul koʻp ketadi, shunday emasmi?

357
00:22:07,407 --> 00:22:12,074
Ha. Qattiq tejayman.

358
00:22:12,097 --> 00:22:16,130
Men ham tejashga qaror qildim.

359
00:22:16,153 --> 00:22:17,653
10-Sahna: Uyning qoidalari / Uyning qoidalari bilan tanishish

360
00:22:17,653 --> 00:22:21,720
Bugundan boshlab iltimos.

361
00:22:21,743 --> 00:22:24,720
Iltimos, marhamat.

362
00:22:24,743 --> 00:22:29,656
Uyning qoidalari haqida tushuntirib beraman.

363
00:22:29,680 --> 00:22:32,676
Ha, iltimos.

364
00:22:32,700 --> 00:22:37,018
Avvalo, axlatni tashlash qoidalariga toʻxtalib oʻtamiz.

365
00:22:37,042 --> 00:22:41,108
Axlatni ajratmasdan tashlab boʻlmaydimi?

366
00:22:41,131 --> 00:22:47,198
Yoʻq. Axlatni albatta ajratib tashlash kerak.

367
00:22:47,221 --> 00:22:49,937
Tushunarli.

368
00:22:49,961 --> 00:22:55,150
Yonuvchi axlatni dushanba va payshanba kunlari tashlash kerak.

369
00:22:55,174 --> 00:22:58,713
Yonmaydigan axlat qachon tashlanadi?

370
00:22:58,736 --> 00:23:03,508
Yonmaydigan axlat juma kunlari tashlanadi.

371
00:23:03,532 --> 00:23:06,965
Yaxshi, eslab qolaman.

372
00:23:06,988 --> 00:23:11,422
Keyin, hammomdan foydalanish qoidalariga oʻtsak.

373
00:23:11,445 --> 00:23:15,401
Hammomga istalgan vaqtda kirib boʻladimi?

374
00:23:15,424 --> 00:23:21,137
Kechasi soat 10 dan keyin hammomga kirmang.

375
00:23:21,160 --> 00:23:23,669
Nima uchun?

376
00:23:23,693 --> 00:23:30,126
Shovqin boʻladi. Boshqalar uxlamasdan oldin kirib oling.

377
00:23:30,149 --> 00:23:32,663
Tushunarli.

378
00:23:32,687 --> 00:23:35,285
Ehtiyot boʻlaman.

379
00:23:35,309 --> 00:23:39,675
Keyin kir yuvish mashinasi haqida.

380
00:23:39,698 --> 00:23:41,465
Ha.

381
00:23:41,488 --> 00:23:48,234
Kir yuvish mashinasidan foydalanishdan oldin choʻntaklarni tekshirib oling.

382
00:23:48,257 --> 00:23:50,524
Tushunarli.

383
00:23:50,547 --> 00:23:54,848
Kechqurun kech kir yuvmang.

384
00:23:54,872 --> 00:23:57,871
Dam olish kunlarida yuving.

385
00:23:57,894 --> 00:24:02,160
Yaxshi, dam olish kunlarida yuvaman.

386
00:24:02,183 --> 00:24:06,518
Oxirida oshxonaning qoidalari.

387
00:24:06,542 --> 00:24:10,175
Ovqat pishirsam boʻladi mi?

388
00:24:10,198 --> 00:24:13,103
Albatta.

389
00:24:13,126 --> 00:24:19,193
Lekin ovqat pishirgandan keyin albatta tozalab qoʻying.

390
00:24:19,216 --> 00:24:22,949
Yaxshi, toza foydalanaman.

391
00:24:22,972 --> 00:24:26,956
Qoidalar shular.

392
00:24:26,979 --> 00:24:31,246
Aniq tushuntirib berganingiz uchun raxmat.

393
00:24:31,269 --> 00:24:36,402
Nimadur tushunmagan boʻlsa, istalgan vaqtda soʻrashingiz mumkin.

394
00:24:36,425 --> 00:24:40,732
Yaxshi, iltimos qilaman.

395
00:24:40,756 --> 00:24:42,256
11-Sahna: Unutilgan narsalar bilan bogʻliq muammo / Unutilgan narsalar bilan bogʻliq muammo

396
00:24:42,256 --> 00:24:45,404
Nima boʻldi?

397
00:24:45,427 --> 00:24:48,403
Ruhiyatingiz yaxshi emasdek.

398
00:24:48,427 --> 00:24:54,694
Aslida, poyezdda sumkamni unutib qoldim.

399
00:24:54,717 --> 00:24:58,877
Voy! Bu juda yomon.

400
00:24:58,900 --> 00:25:04,470
Charchagan edim, shuning uchun poyezdda uxlab qoldim.

401
00:25:04,493 --> 00:25:08,264
Uxlab qolibsan.

402
00:25:08,288 --> 00:25:14,254
Ha, bekatga yetib, shoshilib tushdim.

403
00:25:14,277 --> 00:25:17,711
Sumka nima boʻldi?

404
00:25:17,734 --> 00:25:22,000
Sumkani poyezdning javoniga qoʻydim.

405
00:25:22,023 --> 00:25:24,890
Javonga qoʻydingizmi?

406
00:25:24,913 --> 00:25:32,060
Ha, men tushganimdan keyin darhol eshik yopildi.

407
00:25:32,083 --> 00:25:36,834
A, sumka poyezdda qolgan.

408
00:25:36,858 --> 00:25:42,253
Ha, sumkani qoʻymasligim kerak edi.

409
00:25:42,277 --> 00:25:45,977
Bekat xodimiga aytdingizmi?

410
00:25:46,000 --> 00:25:50,792
Ha, darhol bekat xodimiga aytdim.

411
00:25:50,815 --> 00:25:54,328
Sumka topildi mi?

412
00:25:54,352 --> 00:25:57,585
Hali topilmadi.

413
00:25:57,608 --> 00:26:01,841
Sumkangizda nima bor?

414
00:26:01,864 --> 00:26:05,766
Hamyon va kalitlar bor.

415
00:26:05,790 --> 00:26:10,372
Bu juda muammo ekan.

416
00:26:10,396 --> 00:26:15,029
Ha, koʻproq e’tibor bergan boʻlsam edi.

417
00:26:15,052 --> 00:26:17,519
Ha, shunday.

418
00:26:17,542 --> 00:26:23,493
Kecha kechqurun koʻp ichib qoʻydim.

419
00:26:23,516 --> 00:26:26,616
Koʻp ichib qoʻydingizmi?

420
00:26:26,639 --> 00:26:31,346
Ha, shuning uchun ertalab turolmadim.

421
00:26:31,369 --> 00:26:35,236
Poyezdga kechikib qolish arafasida edingizmi?

422
00:26:35,259 --> 00:26:39,326
Ha, vokzalgacha yugurdim.

423
00:26:39,349 --> 00:26:43,386
Ertaroq turgan boʻlsangiz edi.

424
00:26:43,409 --> 00:26:46,942
Rostdan ham shunday deb oʻylayman.

425
00:26:46,965 --> 00:26:51,632
Sumkangiz tezroq topilsa yaxshi boʻlardi.

426
00:26:51,655 --> 00:26:54,763
Ha, rahmat.

427
00:27:04,795 --> 00:27:06,295
12-Sahna: Kareya pishirishni birga zavqlanamiz / Birgalikda Kareya Tayyorlash

428
00:27:06,295 --> 00:27:10,995
Endi birga ovqat tayyorlaymiz.

429
00:27:11,018 --> 00:27:15,167
Ha, nima pishiramiz?

430
00:27:15,190 --> 00:27:19,379
Bugun kareya pishiramiz.

431
00:27:19,402 --> 00:27:21,988
Yaxshi ekan!

432
00:27:22,011 --> 00:27:26,164
Men nimaga yordam beray?

433
00:27:26,187 --> 00:27:30,254
Unda, sabzavotlarni toʻgʻrang.

434
00:27:30,277 --> 00:27:32,860
Tushunarli.

435
00:27:32,883 --> 00:27:36,717
Sabzi va piyoz, shundaymi?

436
00:27:36,740 --> 00:27:41,573
Ha, men esa goʻshtni qovuraman.

437
00:27:41,596 --> 00:27:45,696
Musiqa tinglab ovqat tayyorlamaymizmi?

438
00:27:45,719 --> 00:27:48,619
Yaxshi ekan!

439
00:27:48,642 --> 00:27:51,942
Sevimli musiqangizni qoʻying.

440
00:27:51,965 --> 00:27:55,665
Unda, jaz qoʻyaman.

441
00:27:55,688 --> 00:28:00,488
Musiqa tinglab tayyorlaganda juda zavqli boʻladi.

442
00:28:00,512 --> 00:28:04,945
Ha, sabzavotlar toʻgʻraldi.

443
00:28:04,968 --> 00:28:07,540
Rahmat.

444
00:28:07,564 --> 00:28:10,754
Qozonga soling.

445
00:28:10,777 --> 00:28:14,644
Ha, qozonga solaman.

446
00:28:14,667 --> 00:28:18,819
Keyin suv quyib qaynatamiz.

447
00:28:18,843 --> 00:28:21,709
Qancha vaqt qaynatamiz?

448
00:28:21,732 --> 00:28:24,966
Yigirma daqiqa atrofida qaynatamiz.

449
00:28:24,989 --> 00:28:27,222
Tushunarli.

450
00:28:27,245 --> 00:28:32,547
Buni solsak, darrov mazali boʻladi.

451
00:28:32,570 --> 00:28:35,239
Bu nima?

452
00:28:35,263 --> 00:28:38,059
Shokolad.

453
00:28:38,082 --> 00:28:43,798
Vay, kareyaga shokolad soladimi?

454
00:28:43,821 --> 00:28:50,354
Ha, shokolad solinsa, taʼmi yumshaydi.

455
00:28:50,377 --> 00:28:54,044
Vay, bilmagan ekanman.

456
00:28:54,067 --> 00:28:57,256
Bir marta sinab koʻring.

457
00:28:57,279 --> 00:29:02,795
Ha, keyingi safar oʻzim tayyorlaganda solib koʻraman.

458
00:29:02,819 --> 00:29:06,174
Yaxshi hid kelib turibdi.

459
00:29:06,197 --> 00:29:11,464
Rostdan ham, qorni ochdi.

460
00:29:11,487 --> 00:29:14,587
Yaqin orada tayyor boʻladi.

461
00:29:14,610 --> 00:29:17,727
Tezroq yeyishni xohlayapman.

462
00:29:17,751 --> 00:29:19,251
13-Sahna: Mehmonxona roʻyxatdan oʻtish tartibi / Mehmonxonaga Roʻyxatdan Oʻtish

463
00:29:19,251 --> 00:29:24,084
Kechirasiz, roʻyxatdan oʻtishni xohlayman.

464
00:29:24,107 --> 00:29:26,622
Xush kelibsiz!

465
00:29:26,646 --> 00:29:30,579
Ismingizni aytib yuborsangiz.

466
00:29:30,602 --> 00:29:32,983
Tanaka.

467
00:29:33,007 --> 00:29:35,707
Tanaka-siz, shundaymi?

468
00:29:35,730 --> 00:29:38,830
Sizni kutayotgan edik.

469
00:29:38,853 --> 00:29:42,237
Internetda band qildim.

470
00:29:42,260 --> 00:29:44,896
Tushunarli, janob.

471
00:29:44,919 --> 00:29:47,753
Tekshirib chiqayapman.

472
00:29:47,776 --> 00:29:50,809
Kechirasiz.

473
00:29:50,832 --> 00:29:55,165
Tanaka nomli band qilingan buyurtmangizni topolmadim.

474
00:29:55,188 --> 00:30:01,455
Voy! Albatta bir oy oldin band qilgan edim.

475
00:30:01,478 --> 00:30:05,028
Qachon band qildingiz?

476
00:30:05,051 --> 00:30:08,626
Oktabrning beshinchi kuni.

477
00:30:08,650 --> 00:30:12,521
Tasdiqlovchi xat ham kelgan bo‘lishi kerak.

478
00:30:12,544 --> 00:30:15,740
Yana bir bor tekshirib chiqaman.

479
00:30:15,764 --> 00:30:18,997
Iltimos, biroz kutib turing.

480
00:30:19,020 --> 00:30:21,654
Ha, iltimos.

481
00:30:21,677 --> 00:30:24,543
Kutib turganingiz uchun uzr.

482
00:30:24,566 --> 00:30:29,338
Tanaka nomli band qilingan buyurtmangizni topdik.

483
00:30:29,361 --> 00:30:32,634
Oh, yaxshi bo‘ldi.

484
00:30:32,658 --> 00:30:36,604
Chin dan uzr so‘raymiz.

485
00:30:36,628 --> 00:30:39,961
Yo‘q, muammo emas.

486
00:30:39,984 --> 00:30:45,217
Bugun siz uchun dengiz ko‘rinishli xonani tayyorladik.

487
00:30:45,240 --> 00:30:48,107
Bu juda yoqimli.

488
00:30:48,130 --> 00:30:51,845
Yuklaringizni olib boramiz.

489
00:30:51,868 --> 00:30:54,172
Rahmat.

490
00:30:54,196 --> 00:30:57,862
Xona o‘ninchi qavatda joylashgan.

491
00:30:57,885 --> 00:31:00,952
Restoran nechanchi qavatda?

492
00:31:00,975 --> 00:31:04,692
Restoran birinchi qavatda joylashgan.

493
00:31:04,715 --> 00:31:08,382
Nonushta soat nechada?

494
00:31:08,405 --> 00:31:13,772
Nonushta soat 7 dan 10 gacha bo‘ladi.

495
00:31:13,795 --> 00:31:16,070
Tushunarli.

496
00:31:16,094 --> 00:31:21,327
Katta hammom ham bor, albatta foydalaning.

497
00:31:21,350 --> 00:31:24,683
Ha, borib ko‘raman.

498
00:31:24,706 --> 00:31:28,810
Endi xonangizga olib boramiz.

499
00:31:28,834 --> 00:31:31,867
Iltimos, marhamat.

500
00:31:31,890 --> 00:31:33,390
14-Sahna: Minnatdorchilik va vidolashuv

501
00:31:33,390 --> 00:31:38,957
Katta, ertadan so‘ng yolg‘iz qolamizdek bo‘ladi, shundaymi?

502
00:31:38,980 --> 00:31:41,178
Ha, shunday.

503
00:31:41,202 --> 00:31:46,268
Uch yil juda tez o‘tdi.

504
00:31:46,291 --> 00:31:51,807
Hozirgacha ko‘p narsalarni o‘rgatib berganingiz uchun katta rahmat.

505
00:31:51,831 --> 00:31:56,210
Yo‘q, men ham sizga rahmat.

506
00:31:56,234 --> 00:32:02,175
Men xato qilganimda har doim yordam berganingizdan xursandman.

507
00:32:02,198 --> 00:32:06,465
Dastlabki vaqtlarda hamma xato qiladi.

508
00:32:06,488 --> 00:32:11,389
Sizning sababingizdan ish yoqimli bo‘ldi.

509
00:32:11,412 --> 00:32:16,482
Bunday gap eshitganimdan xursandman.

510
00:32:16,506 --> 00:32:20,025
Yangi ish joyingizda ham omad tilayman.

511
00:32:20,049 --> 00:32:22,183
Rahmat.

512
00:32:22,206 --> 00:32:25,439
Biroz xavotirdaman.

513
00:32:25,462 --> 00:32:29,605
Siz albatta yaxshi bo‘lasiz.

514
00:32:29,628 --> 00:32:33,007
Siz ham davom etib, harakat qiling.

515
00:32:33,030 --> 00:32:34,811
Ha.

516
00:32:34,835 --> 00:32:37,935
Harakat qilaman.

517
00:32:37,958 --> 00:32:42,912
Nimadir tushunmovchilik bo‘lsa, istalgan vaqtda murojaat qiling.

518
00:32:42,936 --> 00:32:45,302
Rahmat.

519
00:32:45,325 --> 00:32:47,693
Aloqada bo‘laman.

520
00:32:47,717 --> 00:32:51,217
Juda zo‘rlamang.

521
00:32:51,240 --> 00:32:53,140
Ha.

522
00:32:53,162 --> 00:32:55,629
Ehtiyot boʻlaman.

523
00:32:55,652 --> 00:32:59,359
Vaqt-vaqti bilan dam oling.

524
00:32:59,383 --> 00:33:01,686
Ha.

525
00:33:01,709 --> 00:33:06,243
Siz ham yangi muhitda charchaysiz deb o‘ylayman.

526
00:33:06,266 --> 00:33:08,732
Ha, shunday.

527
00:33:08,755 --> 00:33:13,259
Yangi joyda ham sog‘lig‘ingizga e’tibor bering.

528
00:33:13,282 --> 00:33:15,656
Rahmat.

529
00:33:15,679 --> 00:33:18,668
Salomatlik eng muhimi.

530
00:33:18,691 --> 00:33:22,890
Yana birga ovqatlanishga boramiz.

531
00:33:22,913 --> 00:33:25,384
Albatta.

532
00:33:25,407 --> 00:33:27,347
Taklif qiling.

533
00:33:27,371 --> 00:33:29,325
Ha.

534
00:33:29,349 --> 00:33:31,894
Albatta taklif qilaman.

535
00:33:31,917 --> 00:33:34,617
Keyinroq koʻrishamiz.

536
00:33:34,640 --> 00:33:36,718
Ha.

537
00:33:36,742 --> 00:33:40,339
Hozirgacha chin dildan raxmat.

538
00:33:40,362 --> 00:33:44,262
Men ham sizga chin dildan raxmat.

539
00:33:44,285 --> 00:33:46,619
Yaxshi boring.

540
00:33:46,642 --> 00:33:50,542
Siz ham yaxshi boʻling. Xayr.

541
00:33:50,565 --> 00:33:52,065
15-Sahna: Salomlashish va boshlangʻich suhbatlar / Asosiy Salomlashish va Birinchi Suhbatlar

542
00:33:52,065 --> 00:33:54,798
Kechirasiz.

543
00:33:54,821 --> 00:33:57,321
Sizni kutayotgan edik.

544
00:33:57,344 --> 00:34:00,343
Iltimos, kirib oʻting.

545
00:34:00,366 --> 00:34:04,738
Bugun bandligingizda vaqt ajratganingiz uchun raxmat.

546
00:34:04,762 --> 00:34:10,200
Yoʻq, men sizga uzoq yoʻl bosib kelganingiz uchun raxmat.

547
00:34:10,223 --> 00:34:15,557
Men «Mirai» kompaniyasidan Yamada deb atalaman.

548
00:34:15,580 --> 00:34:19,246
Tanishganimdan xursandman. Men Sato.

549
00:34:19,269 --> 00:34:22,502
Har doim yordamingiz uchun raxmat.

550
00:34:22,525 --> 00:34:26,279
Men ham sizga minnatdorman.

551
00:34:26,303 --> 00:34:28,858
Iltimos, oʻtiring.

552
00:34:28,881 --> 00:34:31,514
Kechirasiz.

553
00:34:31,537 --> 00:34:35,104
Bugun poyezdda kelganmisiz?

554
00:34:35,127 --> 00:34:39,366
Ha, Shinkansenda kelganman.

555
00:34:39,389 --> 00:34:42,975
Shundaymi, uzoq boʻlgan boʻlsa kerak.

556
00:34:42,999 --> 00:34:46,981
Yoʻq, ikki soatda yetib keldim.

557
00:34:47,004 --> 00:34:49,904
Bu yaxshi boʻldi.

558
00:34:49,927 --> 00:34:54,723
Bu kichik sovgʻa, iltimos, qabul qiling.

559
00:34:54,747 --> 00:34:58,327
Muraqqabligingiz uchun raxmat.

560
00:34:58,350 --> 00:35:01,088
Bu nima?

561
00:35:01,112 --> 00:35:05,012
Bu «Tokyo Banana» deb ataladigan shirinlik.

562
00:35:05,035 --> 00:35:08,735
A, eshitganman.

563
00:35:08,758 --> 00:35:11,664
Bu juda mashhur shirinlik ekan.

564
00:35:11,687 --> 00:35:16,154
Ha, Tokioda juda mashhur.

565
00:35:16,177 --> 00:35:19,244
Xodimlarimiz bilan birga tatib koʻramiz.

566
00:35:19,267 --> 00:35:23,237
Iltimos, hammangiz birga tatib koʻring.

567
00:35:23,261 --> 00:35:25,627
Rahmat.

568
00:35:25,650 --> 00:35:31,205
Shundan soʻng, yangi mahsulotimiz haqida tushuntirib beraman.

569
00:35:31,229 --> 00:35:34,381
Ha, iltimos.

570
00:35:34,404 --> 00:35:38,598
Ushbu hujjatga nazar tashlasangiz boʻladi.

571
00:35:38,622 --> 00:35:41,924
Ha, koʻray.

572
00:35:41,948 --> 00:35:46,720
Bu mahsulot juda qulay foydalanishga moʻljallangan.

573
00:35:46,743 --> 00:35:51,057
Tushunarli. Dizayni ham yaxshi ekan.

574
00:35:51,081 --> 00:35:53,314
Rahmat.

575
00:35:53,337 --> 00:35:57,171
Biroz oʻylab koʻraman.

576
00:35:57,194 --> 00:35:58,694
16-Sahna: Smartfon tanlashning asosiy nuqtalari / Smartfon Tanlashda Asosiy Nuqtalar

577
00:35:58,694 --> 00:36:03,994
Yangi smartfon sotib olmoqchiman.

578
00:36:04,017 --> 00:36:06,683
Yaxshi ekan!

579
00:36:06,706 --> 00:36:10,615
Qanday smartfon yaxshi boʻladi?

580
00:36:10,639 --> 00:36:16,672
Kamera yaxshi suratga oladimi, shu narsa qiziqtiradi.

581
00:36:16,695 --> 00:36:22,528
Soʻnggi smartfonlarning hammasida kamera yaxshi.

582
00:36:22,551 --> 00:36:25,330
Shundaymi.

583
00:36:25,354 --> 00:36:29,520
Qanday oʻlcham yaxshi boʻladi?

584
00:36:29,543 --> 00:36:34,810
Ekran kichik boʻlsa, koʻrish qiyin boʻladi.

585
00:36:34,833 --> 00:36:38,867
Shunda katta ekran yaxshi boʻladi.

586
00:36:38,890 --> 00:36:44,063
Lekin juda katta boʻlsa, ushlash qiyin.

587
00:36:44,087 --> 00:36:46,856
Rostdan ham.

588
00:36:46,879 --> 00:36:52,346
Doʻkonga borib, haqiqatdan ham ushlab koʻrish yaxshi boʻladi.

589
00:36:52,369 --> 00:36:54,524
Ha, shunday.

590
00:36:54,547 --> 00:36:58,614
Ogʻirligini ham bilasiz-ku.

591
00:36:58,637 --> 00:37:02,470
Bu model haqida qanday oʻylaysiz?

592
00:37:02,493 --> 00:37:06,599
Bu juda mashhur, bilasizmi?

593
00:37:06,623 --> 00:37:10,257
Ishlatish qulaymi?

594
00:37:10,280 --> 00:37:14,513
Ha, juda oson.

595
00:37:14,536 --> 00:37:19,403
Boshlangʻichlar uchun ham qulayligi muhim.

596
00:37:19,425 --> 00:37:24,601
Shunda bu eng tavsiya etiladigan variant.

597
00:37:24,624 --> 00:37:28,258
Batareyka uzoq turadimi?

598
00:37:28,281 --> 00:37:33,714
Ha, kun boʻyi ishlatsangiz ham yetadi.

599
00:37:33,737 --> 00:37:37,697
Buzilmasligi ham muhim.

600
00:37:37,720 --> 00:37:42,387
Yiqilsa ham sinmaydigan shisha ishlatilgan.

601
00:37:42,410 --> 00:37:45,643
Bu yaxshi yangilik!

602
00:37:45,666 --> 00:37:48,974
Qaysi rangni tanlaysiz?

603
00:37:48,998 --> 00:37:52,831
Oq yoki qora oʻrtasida ikkilanyapman.

604
00:37:52,854 --> 00:37:57,042
Menga qora rang juda zoʻr koʻrinadi.

605
00:37:57,066 --> 00:38:00,133
Unda qorani olaman.

606
00:38:00,156 --> 00:38:04,989
Quti ham birga olish yaxshi boʻladi.

607
00:38:05,012 --> 00:38:06,979
Ha, shunday.

608
00:38:07,002 --> 00:38:11,198
Chirkinmaydigan quti izlayman.

609
00:38:11,221 --> 00:38:16,121
Sotib olish uchun borayotganda, men ham birga boraymi?

610
00:38:16,144 --> 00:38:19,811
Ha, iltimos, birga boring.

611
00:38:19,834 --> 00:38:21,334
17-sahna: Gavjum poyezdda muammolar / Muammoli gavjum poyezd

612
00:38:21,334 --> 00:38:24,171
Xayrli tong!

613
00:38:24,194 --> 00:38:27,027
Xayrli tong!

614
00:38:27,050 --> 00:38:31,317
Juda charchagan koʻrinibsiz.

615
00:38:31,340 --> 00:38:38,112
Ha. Bugun ertalab ishga ketayotgan poyezd juda qiyin boʻldi.

616
00:38:38,135 --> 00:38:40,925
Gavjum poyezdmi?

617
00:38:40,949 --> 00:38:46,027
Ha, odatdagidan ham koʻp odam bor edi.

618
00:38:46,051 --> 00:38:49,351
Bu juda qiyin boʻlgan boʻlsa kerak.

619
00:38:49,374 --> 00:38:55,253
Poyezdda oyoqlarimga bosib qoʻyishdi.

620
00:38:55,276 --> 00:38:59,258
Voy! Ogʻriq qilmaganmi?

621
00:38:59,281 --> 00:39:03,453
Ha, juda ogʻridi.

622
00:39:03,476 --> 00:39:06,776
Uzur soʻrashdi?

623
00:39:06,799 --> 00:39:13,699
Yoʻq. Odamlar koʻp edi, kim bosganini bilmadim.

624
00:39:13,722 --> 00:39:17,556
Bu omadingiz yomon chiqdi-ku.

625
00:39:17,578 --> 00:39:20,770
Bundan ham yomoni bor.

626
00:39:20,794 --> 00:39:24,227
Yana nima boʻldi?

627
00:39:24,250 --> 00:39:29,725
Eshik yopilayotganda sumkam siqib qoʻyildi.

628
00:39:29,749 --> 00:39:32,529
Sumkangizmi?

629
00:39:32,552 --> 00:39:35,385
Xavfsizmi?

630
00:39:35,408 --> 00:39:41,247
Keyingi bekatgacha uyalib turdim.

631
00:39:41,271 --> 00:39:45,004
Atrofdagilar koʻrib turardi-ku.

632
00:39:45,027 --> 00:39:50,260
Ha, haqiqatan ham eng yomon tong boʻldi.

633
00:39:50,283 --> 00:39:57,183
Men ham avval poyezdda oʻgʻriga hamyonimni oʻgʻirlatganman.

634
00:39:57,206 --> 00:40:01,782
Voy! Hamyoningizni oʻgʻirlashganmi?

635
00:40:01,805 --> 00:40:06,839
Ha, uxlayotganimda oʻgʻirlashdi.

636
00:40:06,862 --> 00:40:09,772
Bu qoʻrqinchli ekan.

637
00:40:09,795 --> 00:40:14,895
Gavjum poyezdlarda albatta ehtiyot boʻlish kerak.

638
00:40:14,918 --> 00:40:20,052
Ha, bundan keyin sumkamni qattiq ushlab turaman.

639
00:40:20,075 --> 00:40:24,641
Vaqtni biroz oʻzgartirib minish ham yaxshi.

640
00:40:24,664 --> 00:40:26,939
Ha, shunday.

641
00:40:26,963 --> 00:40:31,429
Ertaga uyimdan biroz erta chiqaman.

642
00:40:31,452 --> 00:40:34,352
Bu yaxshi fikr deb oʻylayman.

643
00:40:34,375 --> 00:40:39,052
Bugun ertaroq uyga qaytib, dam olmoqchiman.

644
00:40:39,076 --> 00:40:41,743
Shunday qiling.

645
00:40:41,766 --> 00:40:44,666
Mehnatingiz uchun rahmat.

646
00:40:44,689 --> 00:40:46,189
18-Sahna: Bazm tayyorlash va bezatish

647
00:40:46,189 --> 00:40:50,656
Nihoyat, ertaga bazm bo‘ladi-ku!

648
00:40:50,679 --> 00:40:53,146
Ha, shunday.

649
00:40:53,169 --> 00:40:56,160
Juda ham qiziq!

650
00:40:56,183 --> 00:41:00,250
Xonani bezaymiz.

651
00:41:00,273 --> 00:41:02,106
Ha.

652
00:41:02,129 --> 00:41:05,762
Nima bilan boshlaymiz?

653
00:41:05,785 --> 00:41:10,652
Stolda gullar bor-ku.

654
00:41:10,675 --> 00:41:12,508
Ha.

655
00:41:12,531 --> 00:41:15,705
Kecha sotib oldim.

656
00:41:15,728 --> 00:41:19,109
Juda chiroyli ekan!

657
00:41:19,133 --> 00:41:21,407
Rahmat.

658
00:41:21,430 --> 00:41:26,349
Xonani yanada yorqinroq qilishni xohlayman.

659
00:41:26,373 --> 00:41:28,746
Tushunarli.

660
00:41:28,770 --> 00:41:32,109
Barcha chiroqlarni yoqamiz.

661
00:41:32,133 --> 00:41:36,833
Devorga sharlar osamiz.

662
00:41:36,856 --> 00:41:39,813
Qanday sharlar yaxshi bo‘ladi?

663
00:41:39,836 --> 00:41:44,569
Rang-barang sharlar osishni xohlayman.

664
00:41:44,592 --> 00:41:51,026
Xo‘sh, qizil, ko‘k va sariq sharlarni puflaymiz.

665
00:41:51,049 --> 00:41:53,515
Iltimos.

666
00:41:53,538 --> 00:41:57,905
Men devorga rasmlar yopishtiraman.

667
00:41:57,929 --> 00:42:01,429
Devorga plakatlar ham yopishtirilgan-ku.

668
00:42:01,452 --> 00:42:04,038
Rostdan ham.

669
00:42:04,061 --> 00:42:06,801
Yaxshi ko‘rinibdi.

670
00:42:06,825 --> 00:42:10,292
Musiqa haqida nima deysiz?

671
00:42:10,315 --> 00:42:14,252
Qiziqarli musiqa qo‘yishni xohlayman.

672
00:42:14,275 --> 00:42:19,024
Xo‘sh, bu CDni qo‘yamiz.

673
00:42:19,048 --> 00:42:22,414
Ovoz balandligi qanday?

674
00:42:22,437 --> 00:42:27,504
Ovozni yanada balandroq qilaymizmi?

675
00:42:27,527 --> 00:42:34,304
Yo‘q, gaplashish eshitilmaydi, ovozni biroz pasaytiring.

676
00:42:34,328 --> 00:42:36,961
Tushunarli.

677
00:42:36,984 --> 00:42:40,094
Ovozni pasaytiraman.

678
00:42:40,117 --> 00:42:44,251
Ichimliklar sovutilganmi?

679
00:42:44,274 --> 00:42:46,574
Ha.

680
00:42:46,597 --> 00:42:49,663
Muzlatgichda turibdi.

681
00:42:49,686 --> 00:42:53,960
Idish-tovoq va stakanlar ham chiqarib qo‘yilganmi?

682
00:42:53,983 --> 00:42:58,933
Ha, javon ustiga terib qo‘yilgan.

683
00:42:58,957 --> 00:43:02,457
Tayyorlik mukammal ekan!

684
00:43:02,480 --> 00:43:04,780
Ha.

685
00:43:04,803 --> 00:43:08,574
Ertaga juda qiziqarli bo‘ladi-ku!

686
00:43:08,597 --> 00:43:10,097
19-Sahna: Test natijalari va o‘z-o‘zini tahlil qilish

687
00:43:10,097 --> 00:43:13,997
Takaşi, biroz kel-ku.

688
00:43:14,020 --> 00:43:16,854
Nima, ona?

689
00:43:16,877 --> 00:43:21,224
Bugungi kichik test natijangni ko‘rsat.

690
00:43:21,247 --> 00:43:25,281
Eee, keyinroq ko‘rsataman.

691
00:43:25,304 --> 00:43:28,692
Hozirgina ko‘rsat!

692
00:43:28,715 --> 00:43:31,981
Yaxshi, mana.

693
00:43:32,004 --> 00:43:35,717
Bu nima, bu ballar?

694
00:43:35,741 --> 00:43:38,913
O‘ttiz ballgina-ku.

695
00:43:38,936 --> 00:43:43,236
Chunki qiyin edi-ku.

696
00:43:43,259 --> 00:43:47,596
Har kuni yaxshi o‘qimasang, shunday bo‘ladi.

697
00:43:47,620 --> 00:43:50,795
Ertadan boshlab qattiq o‘qiyman.

698
00:43:50,819 --> 00:43:54,556
Har kuni shunday deysan-ku.

699
00:43:54,579 --> 00:43:59,526
Bugun do‘stlar bilan o‘ynashga va’da bergan edim.

700
00:43:59,549 --> 00:44:02,856
O‘ynashga borishga yo‘l qo‘yilmaydi.

701
00:44:02,880 --> 00:44:06,276
Eee, nega?

702
00:44:06,299 --> 00:44:10,937
Uy vazifangni tugatib bo‘lgandan keyin bor.

703
00:44:10,960 --> 00:44:14,394
Qaytib kelgandan keyin qilaman.

704
00:44:14,417 --> 00:44:16,373
Yo'q.

705
00:44:16,397 --> 00:44:19,897
Hozir darhol uy vazifangizni bajaring.

706
00:44:19,920 --> 00:44:22,787
Yaxshi, bajaraman.

707
00:44:22,810 --> 00:44:27,076
Ko'proq o'qitish kerak, albatta.

708
00:44:27,099 --> 00:44:30,966
Doim o'qishga majburlamang.

709
00:44:30,989 --> 00:44:36,022
Yaxshi baho olsangiz, o'yin sotib beraman.

710
00:44:36,045 --> 00:44:38,356
Rostdanmi?

711
00:44:38,380 --> 00:44:41,513
Albatta sotib ol.

712
00:44:41,536 --> 00:44:47,503
Ha. Keyingi testda sakson balldan yuqori olsangiz.

713
00:44:47,526 --> 00:44:50,668
Yaxshi, harakat qilaman.

714
00:44:50,691 --> 00:44:55,993
Buning oldin xonangizni tozalang.

715
00:44:56,017 --> 00:45:00,283
Eee, xonani ham tozalash kerakmi?

716
00:45:00,306 --> 00:45:03,015
Albatta.

717
00:45:03,039 --> 00:45:07,391
Xona iflos bo'lsa, diqqatni jamlash qiyin.

718
00:45:07,414 --> 00:45:11,548
Yaxshi, hoziroq tozalayman.

719
00:45:11,571 --> 00:45:14,726
Tugatgandan keyin menga ayting.

720
00:45:14,749 --> 00:45:17,383
Haay.

721
00:45:17,406 --> 00:45:18,906
20-Sahna: Mavsumiy ortiqcha ish / Har kuni ortiqcha ishlash do'zaxi

722
00:45:18,906 --> 00:45:23,063
Ah, bugun ham charchadim.

723
00:45:23,086 --> 00:45:25,860
Rostdan ham.

724
00:45:25,883 --> 00:45:30,117
Yaqinda doimo ortiqcha ishlayapman.

725
00:45:30,140 --> 00:45:34,077
Kecha soat nechada uyga qaytdingiz?

726
00:45:34,100 --> 00:45:37,576
Kechasi soat o'n birda.

727
00:45:37,600 --> 00:45:41,953
Bo'lim boshlig'i menga kechgacha ishlattirdi.

728
00:45:41,976 --> 00:45:45,730
Bu juda qiyin boʻlgan boʻlsa kerak.

729
00:45:45,753 --> 00:45:50,656
Barcha hujjatlarni qayta yozishga majbur qildim.

730
00:45:50,679 --> 00:45:54,394
Hammasini qayta yozdingizmi?

731
00:45:54,418 --> 00:45:59,085
Ha, rostan ham jirkanch keldi.

732
00:45:59,108 --> 00:46:06,014
Har kuni shunday ishlashga chidab bo'lmaydi.

733
00:46:06,037 --> 00:46:11,072
Ha, qanchalik uxlasam ham charchoq ketmaydi.

734
00:46:11,095 --> 00:46:14,329
Dam olish kunlari ham ishlaysizmi?

735
00:46:14,352 --> 00:46:19,018
Yakshanba kuni ham ofisga kelishga majbur qilinaman.

736
00:46:19,041 --> 00:46:22,584
Dam olish kuni yo'q ekan.

737
00:46:22,607 --> 00:46:25,274
Ha, shunday.

738
00:46:25,297 --> 00:46:28,730
Tinchgina dam olishni xohlayman.

739
00:46:28,753 --> 00:46:34,312
Rahbarga shikoyat qilsangiz ham hech narsa o'zgarmaydi.

740
00:46:34,336 --> 00:46:38,769
Ha, qanchalik aytganimda ham befoyda deb o'ylayman.

741
00:46:38,792 --> 00:46:45,826
Menga ham yaqinda ko'plab yangi ishlar yuklatilmoqda.

742
00:46:45,850 --> 00:46:48,528
Ikkalamiz ham qiyin ahvolda ekanmiz.

743
00:46:48,551 --> 00:46:53,733
Men keyingi oy belgilangan vaqtda ketishga qaror qildim.

744
00:46:53,757 --> 00:46:57,590
Haqiqatan ham vaqtida ketishingiz mumkinmi?

745
00:46:57,613 --> 00:47:04,164
Ha, qanchalik band bo'lmasam ham, o'z vaqtimni qadrlayman.

746
00:47:04,188 --> 00:47:07,621
Bu yaxshi qaror ekan.

747
00:47:07,644 --> 00:47:12,439
Doim ishlash hayoti yoqmaydi.

748
00:47:12,463 --> 00:47:17,797
Men ham bundan keyin ishlarni rad etishga qaror qildim.

749
00:47:17,820 --> 00:47:23,486
Shunday, imkoni bo'lmasa, imkoni yo'q deb aytish kerak.

750
00:47:23,509 --> 00:47:28,818
Ha, o'z sog'lig'im eng muhim.

751
00:47:28,842 --> 00:47:33,175
Unda, bugun erta ketmaymizmi?

752
00:47:33,198 --> 00:47:38,376
Ha, bugun erta ketishga qaror qildim.

753
00:47:38,400 --> 00:47:40,916
Mehnatingiz uchun rahmat.

754
00:47:40,940 --> 00:47:43,933
Mehnatingiz uchun rahmat.